    },
    {
      "text": "So, yeah, private equity, those kind of companies are coming in as well now, which is great because in 2025, you know, due to politics and all that, there was like a lot of what's called dry powder.",
      "speaker_name": "Ahmed Zia",
      "start_time": 567.37,
